us", "B": "Invalid pension", "C": "Overtime", "D": "Allowance"}, "answer": "B", "i": "qjcu9d1pe2l"}, {"q": "Abolition of a permanent post entitles the holder to:", "options": {"A": "Fine", "B": "Compensation pension", "C": "Donation", "D": "Bonus"}, "answer": "B", "i": "q1p3bql959wm"}, {"q": "Compulsory retirement as punishment carries:", "options": {"A": "No benefits", "B": "Pensionary benefits as admissible", "C": "Double pension", "D": "Bonus"}, "answer": "B", "i": "q1bsoe1dkmel"}, {"q": "Resignation from railway service entails:", "options": {"A": "Double pension", "B": "Forfeiture of past service", "C": "Bonus", "D": "Full pension"}, "answer": "B", "i": "q1sou3ptwmvq"}, {"q": "Dismissal from service results in:", "options": {"A": "Full pension", "B": "Forfeiture, with possible compassionate allowance", "C": "Double pension", "D": "Bonus"}, "answer": "B", "i": "quwi5tjypvh"}, {"q": "Death attributable to duty gives the family:", "options": {"A": "Overtime", "B": "Extraordinary pension", "C": "Fine", "D": "Bonus"}, "answer": "B", "i": "q7jqqvl5j8b"}, {"q": "Severely disabled pensioners needing an attendant get:", "options": {"A": "Bonus", "B": "Constant attendance allowance", "C": "Overtime", "D": "Fine"}, "answer": "B", "i": "q1vp19cwy85"}, {"q": "Pension paid pending final settlement is called:", "options": {"A": "Advance salary", "B": "Provisional pension", "C": "Loan", "D": "Bonus"}, "answer": "B", "i": "qq527q58wyl"}, {"q": "Pension authorised before all papers are complete is:", "options": {"A": "Fine", "B": "Bonus", "C": "Anticipatory pension", "D": "Overtime"}, "answer": "C", "i": "qwq3f6sx9v4"}, {"q": "Retirement benefit for service under 10 years is called:", "options": {"A": "Bonus", "B": "Fine", "C": "Service gratuity", "D": "Donation"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q17v2olyazfp"}, {"q": "Inordinate delay in settling retirement dues attracts:", "options": {"A": "Fine", "B": "Never", "C": "Interest on delayed payment", "D": "Bonus"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q2fna